<title>JAPAN: Stock ratings list-Kankaku Research (Jul 28).</title>
<headline>Stock ratings list-Kankaku Research (Jul 28).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Follows is a list of ratings on Monday by Kankaku Research Institute Inc.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>First time rated:</p>
<p>Nippon Muki Co Ltd -- &quot;2&quot;</p>
<p>Mitsumi Electric Co Ltd -- &quot;2&quot;</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The research institute assigns ratings as follows:</p>
<p>&quot;1&quot; - issues expected to outperform the TOPIX by more than 10 percentage points over the next six months.</p>
<p>&quot;2&quot; - issues seen moving within 10 percentage points in either direction of the TOPIX over the next six months.</p>
<p>&quot;3&quot; - issues expected to underperform the TOPIX by more than 10 percentage points over the next six months.</p>
</text>
